 R←Test_SendEmail_55(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕IO;⎕ML;⎕TRAP;connection;rc;msg;log
⍝ A server that refuses service right away
 ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 ∆SERVER.Defaults
 ∆SERVER.Greeting←'554 5.3.2 No service'
 connection←⎕NEW SMTP.Connection(,⊂∆NewParms)
 (rc msg log)←connection.Send ∆NewMail'Created by SMTP''s ',⊃⎕SI
 ∆SERVER.Defaults
 →T.PassesIf 1=rc
 →T.PassesIf'554 5.3.2 No service'≡msg
 →T.PassesIf~⊃connection.Connected

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
